<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-creating-tags">
  <title>Create Tags</title>
  
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>tags</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>creating tags</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p>Use tags to capture a specific point in history, such as a release. A tag is similar to a
      branch, but it does not change. Use <xref
        href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_create_tag"><uicontrol>Create
          Tag</uicontrol></xref> from the <xref
        href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history"
        format="dita"><uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol> view</xref> context menu.</p>
    <p>
      <fig id="fig_git_create_tag_dialog">
        <title>Create Tag Dialog Box</title>
        <image href="img/dialogs/create_tag.png" placement="inline"
          id="image_git_create_tag_dialog"/>
      </fig>
    </p>
    <p>To manage tags, use <xref
        href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_tags"><uicontrol>Show tags</uicontrol></xref> from the <xref
        href="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface.dita#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface/section_git_staging_ellipsis_menu"><uicontrol><image
            href="../img/Ellipsis18.png"/>Vertical Ellipsis</uicontrol> menu</xref> or from the
        main <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol> menu.</p>
    <p>
      <fig id="fig_git_tags_dialog">
        <title>Tags Dialog Box</title>
        <image href="img/dialogs/tags_dialog.png" placement="inline"
          id="image_git_tags_dialog"/>
      </fig>
    </p>
  </body>
</topic>